This repository holds two implementations of one language — `typescript/` and
`elixir/` — and the specification that arbitrates between them, `spec/`.

The Elixir implementation was extracted from Elixip
(https://github.com/neutrino38/elixip) on 2026-09-12 and relicensed from
BUSL-1.1 to Apache-2.0 by its copyright holder, so that both implementations
ship under one licence. Elixip itself remains under BUSL-1.1 and consumes this
package as an ordinary permissive dependency; `elixir/NOTICE` records the
provenance of that half in detail. The copyright range starts in 2024 because
part of the extracted code — the context the state machine keeps about itself —
is that old in Elixip's history.

Most commits in this repository carry the author address emmanuel.buu@ives.fr,
a work address of the person named above. The copyright holder is as stated
above.
